    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible light-induced, copper-catalyzed aerobic oxidation of terminal alkynes to glyoxals, which are then converted into \u03b1-keto esters, quinoxalines, or naphthoquinones. Using CuI as a catalyst and 2-picolinic acid as a ligand, the method achieves controlled oxidation without over-oxidation to glyoxalic acid or unwanted homocoupling, even with primary, secondary, and tertiary alcohols.",
